 230:Drivers/lvgl/src/draw/sw/blend/lv_draw_sw_blend_to_rgb565.c ****  * One masked pixel: leave it alone, store the color, or mix.
 231:Drivers/lvgl/src/draw/sw/blend/lv_draw_sw_blend_to_rgb565.c ****  * A macro because -Os doesn't inline helpers, and this runs on every pixel.
